    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "35fc58c4b60acdc8afe8": "Surely Mot didn't send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him. ",
        "5e7f001415c45e8b690d": "I will teach you... soon. I require a demonstration of your loyalty, first.",
        "9bc5d16778e1c2c5975c": "There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training.",
        "b03e0dd8074e4c0cdfac": "Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now.",
        "dbfc8a1fd82f3c1b42a6": "Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin...",
        "fe8e13b8e302bfe2f6ea": "Train me."
      },
      "name": "Teg Dawnstrider",
      "subName": "Expert Enchanter",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
